@host = http://localhost:8080

### Provider 1 – create / resubmit
POST {{host}}/api/v1/providers/provider1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emp_id": "P1_001",
  "first_name": "Alice",
  "last_name": "Johnson",
  "email_address": "alice.johnson@provider1.com",
  "phone": "+1-555-0101",
  "job_title": "Security Officer",
  "dept": "Security Operations",
  "hire_date": "2024-01-15",
  "employment_status": "active"
}

### Provider 2
POST {{host}}/api/v1/providers/provider2/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_number": "P2_001",
  "personal_info": { "given_name": "Carol", "family_name": "Davis", "email": "carol.davis@provider2.com", "mobile": "+1-555-0201" },
  "work_info": { "role": "Security Guard", "division": "Night Shift Security", "start_date": "2024-02-01", "current_status": "employed" }
}

### Read back
GET {{host}}/api/v1/employees/provider1/P1_001

### Validation error (400)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/providers/provider1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{ "emp_id": "P1_999", "first_name": "", "email_address": "not-an-email" }

### OpenAPI
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
